{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_27","type":"command_execution","command":"\"C:\\\\Program Files\\\\PowerShell\\\\7\\\\pwsh.exe\" -Command 'Get-Content -Raw README.md'","aggregated_output":"# Tic-Tac-Toe Benchmark\n\nThis directory contains a self-contained tic-tac-toe game in `tictactoe.html` and a Node.js test file in `tictactoe.test.js`.\n\n## Open the game\n\nOpen `tictactoe.html` directly from disk by double-clicking it or opening it in a browser with a `file://` URL. No web server, build step, or package install is required.\n\n## Run the tests\n\nRun the unit tests with built-in Node.js only:\n\n```bash\nnode --test tictactoe.test.js\n```\n\nThe test harness reads the embedded script from `tictactoe.html`, evaluates it with Node's `vm` module, and asserts the exported pure game logic and score helpers.\n\n## Scope\n\nIncluded:\n- Single-file HTML game with inline CSS and JavaScript\n- Two-player local play on one device\n- Win and draw detection with winning cells highlighted\n- Restart button for the current round\n- Persistent scoreboard for X wins, O wins, and draws via `localStorage`\n- Built-in Node.js unit tests for the embedded logic\n\nOut of scope:\n- Computer AI opponent\n- Network or multiplayer synchronization\n- Asset pipelines, npm packages, or build tooling\n- Resetting the persistent scoreboard\n\n## Anything not done\n\nNothing else was added beyond the benchmark requirements above.\n\r\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_30","type":"command_execution","command":"\"C:\\\\Program Files\\\\PowerShell\\\\7\\\\pwsh.exe\" -Command 'Get-Content -Raw tictactoe.html'","aggregated_output":"<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n  <title>Tic-Tac-Toe</title>\n  <style>\n    :root {\n      color-scheme: light;\n      --bg: #f4efe6;\n      --panel: #fffaf2;\n      --grid: #3f3a34;\n      --accent: #d96c3d;\n      --accent-soft: #f1c8b7;\n      --win: #a6d49f;\n      --text: #1f1b18;\n      --muted: #6d6258;\n      --shadow: 0 18px 40px rgba(63, 58, 52, 0.14);\n    }\n\n    * {\n      box-sizing: border-box;\n    }\n\n    body {\n      margin: 0;\n      min-height: 100vh;\n      display: flex;\n      align-items: center;\n      justify-content: center;\n      padding: 24px;\n      font-family: \"Trebuchet MS\", \"Segoe UI\", sans-serif;\n      background:\n        radial-gradient(circle at top, rgba(217, 108, 61, 0.18), transparent 38%),\n        linear-gradient(160deg, #f7f0e5 0%, #efe7da 100%);\n      color: var(--text);\n    }\n\n    .game-shell {\n      width: min(100%, 720px);\n      background: var(--panel);\n      border: 2px solid rgba(63, 58, 52, 0.14);\n      border-radius: 8px;\n      box-shadow: var(--shadow);\n      overflow: hidden;\n    }\n\n    .hero {\n      padding: 28px 28px 20px;\n      background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(217, 108, 61, 0.18), rgba(166, 212, 159, 0.28));\n      border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(63, 58, 52, 0.12);\n    }\n\n    h1 {\n      margin: 0 0 10px;\n      font-size: 2rem;\n      letter-spacing: 0.04em;\n      text-transform: uppercase;\n    }\n\n    .status {\n      margin: 0;\n      font-size: 1rem;\n      color: var(--muted);\n      min-height: 1.5em;\n    }\n\n    .content {\n      display: grid;\n      grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1.25fr) minmax(220px, 0.75fr);\n      gap: 24px;\n      padding: 24px 28px 28px;\n    }\n\n    .board {\n      display: grid;\n      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));\n      gap: 10px;\n      margin: 0;\n      padding: 0;\n      border: 0;\n      min-width: 0;\n    }\n\n    .cell {\n      appearance: none;\n      border: 2px solid var(--grid);\n      border-radius: 8px;\n      background: #fff;\n      color: var(--text);\n      aspect-ratio: 1;\n      font: inherit;\n      font-size: clamp(2rem, 7vw, 3.5rem);\n      font-weight: 700;\n      cursor: pointer;\n      transition: transform 120ms ease, background-color 120ms ease, box-shadow 120ms ease;\n    }\n\n    .cell:hover:not(:disabled),\n    .cell:focus-visible:not(:disabled) {\n      transform: translateY(-1px);\n      box-shadow: 0 10px 18px rgba(63, 58, 52, 0.14);\n      outline: none;\n    }\n\n    .cell[data-mark=\"X\"] {\n      color: #8c2f39;\n    }\n\n    .cell[data-mark=\"O\"] {\n      color: #235789;\n    }\n\n    .cell.win {\n      background: var(--win);\n    }\n\n    .cell:disabled {\n      cursor: default;\n    }\n\n    .sidebar {\n      display: grid;\n      gap: 16px;\n      align-content: start;\n    }\n\n    .panel {\n      border: 1px solid rgba(63, 58, 52, 0.14);\n      border-radius: 8px;\n      padding: 18px;\n      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.75);\n    }\n\n    .panel h2 {\n      margin: 0 0 12px;\n      font-size: 1rem;\n      text-transform: uppercase;\n      letter-spacing: 0.08em;\n    }\n\n    .score-list {\n      list-style: none;\n      padding: 0;\n      margin: 0;\n      display: grid;\n      gap: 10px;\n    }\n\n    .score-list li {\n      display: flex;\n      justify-content: space-between;\n      align-items: center;\n      padding-bottom: 8px;\n      border-bottom: 1px dashed rgba(63, 58, 52, 0.14);\n    }\n\n    .score-list li:last-child {\n      border-bottom: 0;\n      padding-bottom: 0;\n    }\n\n    .score-value {\n      font-weight: 700;\n      font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;\n    }\n\n    .restart {\n      appearance: none;\n      border: 0;\n      border-radius: 8px;\n      padding: 14px 16px;\n      font: inherit;\n      font-weight: 700;\n      color: #fff;\n      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #d96c3d, #c6502a);\n      cursor: pointer;\n      box-shadow: 0 12px 24px rgba(217, 108, 61, 0.28);\n    }\n\n    .restart:hover,\n    .restart:focus-visible {\n      outline: none;\n      filter: brightness(1.04);\n    }\n\n    .legend {\n      margin: 0;\n      color: var(--muted);\n      line-height: 1.5;\n    }\n\n    @media (max-width: 720px) {\n      .content {\n        grid-template-columns: 1fr;\n      }\n    }\n  </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n  <main class=\"game-shell\">\n    <section class=\"hero\">\n      <h1>Tic-Tac-Toe</h1>\n      <p id=\"status\" class=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\">Player X to move.</p>\n    </section>\n    <section class=\"content\">\n      <section aria-label=\"Tic-tac-toe board\">\n        <div id=\"board\" class=\"board\" role=\"grid\" aria-label=\"Tic-tac-toe board\">\n          <button class=\"cell\" type=\"button\" data-index=\"0\" aria-label=\"Cell 1\"></button>\n          <button class=\"cell\" type=\"button\" data-index=\"1\" aria-label=\"Cell 2\"></button>\n          <button class=\"cell\" type=\"button\" data-index=\"2\" aria-label=\"Cell 3\"></button>\n          <button class=\"cell\" type=\"button\" data-index=\"3\" aria-label=\"Cell 4\"></button>\n          <button class=\"cell\" type=\"button\" data-index=\"4\" aria-label=\"Cell 5\"></button>\n          <button class=\"cell\" type=\"button\" data-index=\"5\" aria-label=\"Cell 6\"></button>\n          <button class=\"cell\" type=\"button\" data-index=\"6\" aria-label=\"Cell 7\"></button>\n          <button class=\"cell\" type=\"button\" data-index=\"7\" aria-label=\"Cell 8\"></button>\n          <button class=\"cell\" type=\"button\" data-index=\"8\" aria-label=\"Cell 9\"></button>\n        </div>\n      </section>\n      <aside class=\"sidebar\">\n        <section class=\"panel\" aria-labelledby=\"score-heading\">\n          <h2 id=\"score-heading\">Scoreboard</h2>\n          <ul class=\"score-list\">\n            <li><span>X wins</span><span id=\"score-x\" class=\"score-value\">0</span></li>\n            <li><span>O wins</span><span id=\"score-o\" class=\"score-value\">0</span></li>\n            <li><span>Draws</span><span id=\"score-draws\" class=\"score-value\">0</span></li>\n          </ul>\n        </section>\n        <button id=\"restart\" class=\"restart\" type=\"button\">Restart Round</button>\n        <section class=\"panel\">\n          <p class=\"legend\">Two players share the same device. Win highlights stay visible until the next round.</p>\n        </section>\n      </aside>\n    </section>\n  </main>\n  <script>\n    (function () {\n      var STORAGE_KEY = \"tic-tac-toe-scoreboard\";\n      var WINNING_LINES = [\n        [0, 1, 2],\n        [3, 4, 5],\n        [6, 7, 8],\n        [0, 3, 6],\n        [1, 4, 7],\n        [2, 5, 8],\n        [0, 4, 8],\n        [2, 4, 6]\n      ];\n\n      function defaultScores() {\n        return { X: 0, O: 0, draws: 0 };\n      }\n\n      function normalizeScores(value) {\n        if (!value || typeof value !== \"object\") {\n          return defaultScores();\n        }\n\n        return {\n          X: Number.isFinite(value.X) ? value.X : 0,\n          O: Number.isFinite(value.O) ? value.O : 0,\n          draws: Number.isFinite(value.draws) ? value.draws : 0\n        };\n      }\n\n      function evaluateBoard(board) {\n        var lineIndex;\n        var line;\n        var first;\n\n        for (lineIndex = 0; lineIndex < WINNING_LINES.length; lineIndex += 1) {\n          line = WINNING_LINES[lineIndex];\n          first = board[line[0]];\n\n          if (first && first === board[line[1]] && first === board[line[2]]) {\n            return {\n              winner: first,\n              draw: false,\n              status: \"win\",\n              winningLine: line.slice()\n            };\n          }\n        }\n\n        if (board.every(function (cell) { return cell === \"X\" || cell === \"O\"; })) {\n          return {\n            winner: null,\n            draw: true,\n            status: \"draw\",\n            winningLine: []\n          };\n        }\n\n        return {\n          winner: null,\n          draw: false,\n          status: \"in-progress\",\n          winningLine: []\n        };\n      }\n\n      function loadScores() {\n        var raw;\n\n        try {\n          raw = globalThis.localStorage && globalThis.localStorage.getItem(STORAGE_KEY);\n        } catch (error) {\n          raw = null;\n        }\n\n        if (!raw) {\n          return defaultScores();\n        }\n\n        try {\n          return normalizeScores(JSON.parse(raw));\n        } catch (error) {\n          return defaultScores();\n        }\n      }\n\n      function saveScores(scores) {\n        var nextScores = normalizeScores(scores);\n\n        try {\n          if (globalThis.localStorage) {\n            globalThis.localStorage.setItem(STORAGE_KEY, JSON.stringify(nextScores));\n          }\n        } catch (error) {\n          return nextScores;\n        }\n\n        return nextScores;\n      }\n\n      function recordOutcome(scores, result) {\n        var nextScores = normalizeScores(scores);\n\n        if (result.winner === \"X\") {\n          nextScores.X += 1;\n        } else if (result.winner === \"O\") {\n          nextScores.O += 1;\n        } else if (result.draw) {\n          nextScores.draws += 1;\n        }\n\n        return nextScores;\n      }\n\n      function createInitialState() {\n        return {\n          board: [\"\", \"\", \"\", \"\", \"\", \"\", \"\", \"\", \"\"],\n          currentPlayer: \"X\",\n          result: {\n            winner: null,\n            draw: false,\n            status: \"in-progress\",\n            winningLine: []\n          },\n          scores: loadScores(),\n          gameOver: false\n        };\n      }\n\n      function render(state, elements) {\n        var completed = state.gameOver;\n\n        elements.cells.forEach(function (cell, index) {\n          var mark = state.board[index];\n          var isWinner = state.result.winningLine.indexOf(index) !== -1;\n\n          cell.textContent = mark;\n          cell.dataset.mark = mark;\n          cell.disabled = completed || Boolean(mark);\n          cell.classList.toggle(\"win\", isWinner);\n          cell.setAttribute(\"aria-label\", \"Cell \" + (index + 1) + (mark ? \": \" + mark : \"\"));\n        });\n\n        if (state.result.status === \"win\") {\n          elements.status.textContent = \"Player \" + state.result.winner + \" wins.\";\n        } else if (state.result.status === \"draw\") {\n          elements.status.textContent = \"Round ends in a draw.\";\n        } else {\n          elements.status.textContent = \"Player \" + state.currentPlayer + \" to move.\";\n        }\n\n        elements.scoreX.textContent = String(state.scores.X);\n        elements.scoreO.textContent = String(state.scores.O);\n        elements.scoreDraws.textContent = String(state.scores.draws);\n      }\n\n      function initGame() {\n        var boardElement = document.getElementById(\"board\");\n        var statusElement = document.getElementById(\"status\");\n        var restartButton = document.getElementById(\"restart\");\n\n        if (!boardElement || !statusElement || !restartButton) {\n          return;\n        }\n\n        var elements = {\n          board: boardElement,\n          status: statusElement,\n          restart: restartButton,\n          cells: Array.prototype.slice.call(boardElement.querySelectorAll(\".cell\")),\n          scoreX: document.getElementById(\"score-x\"),\n          scoreO: document.getElementById(\"score-o\"),\n          scoreDraws: document.getElementById(\"score-draws\")\n        };\n        var state = createInitialState();\n\n        function restartRound() {\n          state.board = [\"\", \"\", \"\", \"\", \"\", \"\", \"\", \"\", \"\"];\n          state.currentPlayer = \"X\";\n          state.result = {\n            winner: null,\n            draw: false,\n            status: \"in-progress\",\n            winningLine: []\n          };\n          state.gameOver = false;\n          render(state, elements);\n        }\n\n        function handleMove(index) {\n          if (state.gameOver || state.board[index]) {\n            return;\n          }\n\n          state.board[index] = state.currentPlayer;\n          state.result = evaluateBoard(state.board);\n\n          if (state.result.status === \"win\" || state.result.status === \"draw\") {\n            state.gameOver = true;\n            state.scores = recordOutcome(state.scores, state.result);\n            saveScores(state.scores);\n          } else {\n            state.currentPlayer = state.currentPlayer === \"X\" ? \"O\" : \"X\";\n          }\n\n          render(state, elements);\n        }\n\n        elements.cells.forEach(function (cell) {\n          cell.addEventListener(\"click\", function () {\n            handleMove(Number(cell.dataset.index));\n          });\n        });\n\n        elements.restart.addEventListener(\"click\", restartRound);\n        render(state, elements);\n      }\n\n      var TicTacToeLogic = {\n        evaluateBoard: evaluateBoard,\n        loadScores: loadScores,\n        saveScores: saveScores,\n        recordOutcome: recordOutcome,\n        defaultScores: defaultScores\n      };\n\n      globalThis.TicTacToeLogic = TicTacToeLogic;\n\n      if (globalThis.document && typeof globalThis.document.addEventListener === \"function\") {\n        globalThis.document.addEventListener(\"DOMContentLoaded\", initGame);\n      }\n    }());\n  </script>\n</body>\n</html>\n\r\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_26","type":"command_execution","command":"\"C:\\\\Program Files\\\\PowerShell\\\\7\\\\pwsh.exe\" -Command 'Get-Content -Raw tictactoe.test.js'","aggregated_output":"const test = require(\"node:test\");\nconst assert = require(\"node:assert/strict\");\nconst fs = require(\"node:fs\");\nconst path = require(\"node:path\");\nconst vm = require(\"node:vm\");\n\nconst htmlPath = path.join(__dirname, \"tictactoe.html\");\n\nfunction loadLogic() {\n  const html = fs.readFileSync(htmlPath, \"utf8\");\n  const match = html.match(/<script>([\\s\\S]*?)<\\/script>/i);\n\n  if (!match) {\n    throw new Error(\"Expected an inline script in tictactoe.html\");\n  }\n\n  const sandbox = {\n    console,\n    __storage: {},\n    localStorage: null,\n    document: {\n      addEventListener() {},\n    },\n    window: {},\n  };\n  sandbox.localStorage = {\n    getItem(key) {\n      return Object.prototype.hasOwnProperty.call(sandbox.__storage, key)\n        ? sandbox.__storage[key]\n        : null;\n    },\n    setItem(key, value) {\n      sandbox.__storage[key] = String(value);\n    },\n  };\n  sandbox.globalThis = sandbox;\n\n  vm.createContext(sandbox);\n  vm.runInContext(match[1], sandbox, { filename: \"tictactoe.html\" });\n\n  return {\n    logic: sandbox.TicTacToeLogic,\n    storage: sandbox.__storage,\n  };\n}\n\nfunction plain(value) {\n  return JSON.parse(JSON.stringify(value));\n}\n\ntest(\"exposes evaluateBoard from the embedded HTML script\", () => {\n  const { logic } = loadLogic();\n\n  assert.equal(typeof logic, \"object\");\n  assert.equal(typeof logic.evaluateBoard, \"function\");\n});\n\ntest(\"detects a horizontal win and returns the winning line\", () => {\n  const { logic } = loadLogic();\n  const result = plain(logic.evaluateBoard([\"X\", \"X\", \"X\", \"\", \"O\", \"\", \"O\", \"\", \"\"]));\n\n  assert.deepEqual(result, {\n    winner: \"X\",\n    draw: false,\n    status: \"win\",\n    winningLine: [0, 1, 2],\n  });\n});\n\ntest(\"detects a vertical win\", () => {\n  const { logic } = loadLogic();\n  const result = plain(logic.evaluateBoard([\"O\", \"X\", \"\", \"O\", \"X\", \"\", \"O\", \"\", \"X\"]));\n\n  assert.deepEqual(result, {\n    winner: \"O\",\n    draw: false,\n    status: \"win\",\n    winningLine: [0, 3, 6],\n  });\n});\n\ntest(\"detects a diagonal win\", () => {\n  const { logic } = loadLogic();\n  const result = plain(logic.evaluateBoard([\"X\", \"O\", \"\", \"\", \"X\", \"O\", \"\", \"\", \"X\"]));\n\n  assert.deepEqual(result, {\n    winner: \"X\",\n    draw: false,\n    status: \"win\",\n    winningLine: [0, 4, 8],\n  });\n});\n\ntest(\"detects a draw when the board is full with no winner\", () => {\n  const { logic } = loadLogic();\n  const result = plain(logic.evaluateBoard([\"X\", \"O\", \"X\", \"X\", \"O\", \"O\", \"O\", \"X\", \"X\"]));\n\n  assert.deepEqual(result, {\n    winner: null,\n    draw: true,\n    status: \"draw\",\n    winningLine: [],\n  });\n});\n\ntest(\"reports an unfinished board as in progress\", () => {\n  const { logic } = loadLogic();\n  const result = plain(logic.evaluateBoard([\"X\", \"O\", \"\", \"\", \"X\", \"\", \"\", \"\", \"O\"]));\n\n  assert.deepEqual(result, {\n    winner: null,\n    draw: false,\n    status: \"in-progress\",\n    winningLine: [],\n  });\n});\n\ntest(\"loads default scores when localStorage is empty\", () => {\n  const { logic } = loadLogic();\n  const scores = plain(logic.loadScores());\n\n  assert.deepEqual(scores, {\n    X: 0,\n    O: 0,\n    draws: 0,\n  });\n});\n\ntest(\"increments and saves the winner score once\", () => {\n  const { logic } = loadLogic();\n  const scores = { X: 0, O: 1, draws: 2 };\n  const nextScores = plain(logic.recordOutcome(scores, { winner: \"X\", draw: false }));\n\n  assert.deepEqual(nextScores, {\n    X: 1,\n    O: 1,\n    draws: 2,\n  });\n});\n\ntest(\"increments draw count when the outcome is a draw\", () => {\n  const { logic } = loadLogic();\n  const scores = { X: 3, O: 4, draws: 0 };\n  const nextScores = plain(logic.recordOutcome(scores, { winner: null, draw: true }));\n\n  assert.deepEqual(nextScores, {\n    X: 3,\n    O: 4,\n    draws: 1,\n  });\n});\n\ntest(\"saves scores to localStorage and loads them on the next read\", () => {\n  const { logic, storage } = loadLogic();\n  const scores = { X: 2, O: 1, draws: 3 };\n\n  logic.saveScores(scores);\n\n  assert.equal(storage[\"tic-tac-toe-scoreboard\"], JSON.stringify(scores));\n  assert.deepEqual(plain(logic.loadScores()), scores);\n});\n\r\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
